    <textTemplates>
        <name>FundedEmailBody</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Confirmation of Trust Establishment for {!$Record.Bene_First_Name__c} &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt; {!$Record.Bene_Last_Name__c}&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Dear {!$Record.Primary_Rep_Contact_Lookup__r.FirstName} &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Primary_Rep_Contact_Lookup__r.LastName}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Welcome to the Master Pooled Trust! We are pleased to inform you that the Joinder Agreement {!$Record.Trust_Type__c} submitted on behalf of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Bene_First_Name__c}  {!$Record.Bene_Last_Name__c} &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;has been approved.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;After approval, it may take up to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;ten (10) business days&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;for the paperwork to be fully processed in our system with enrollment fee and/or funding check(s) deposited if sent.&amp;nbsp;We kindly ask for your patience during this process.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;If a funding check was mailed with the Joinder Agreement, it will be deposited on the next scheduled deposit date once paperwork processing is complete. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Bene_First_Name__c}  {!$Record.Bene_Last_Name__c}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;’s Trust sub-account number will be assigned at that time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;NOTE: A 10-day holding period will apply to any new funds deposited.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;This standard practice is in place primarily to protect both the Beneficiary and the Trust from potential issues such as fraud or insufficient funds. The bank uses this time to verify that the check is valid and that the payer’s account has sufficient funds. This holding period helps prevent returned checks, overdraft fees and ensures that the funds are securely and fully available for &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Bene_First_Name__c}  {!$Record.Bene_Last_Name__c}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;’s sole benefit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;After the Joinder Agreement is processed in our system and the checks are deposited, our Enrollment Team will prepare and send a&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Master Pooled Trust Toolkit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;(&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;{!ToolkitURL}&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Digital Version&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;) to the Primary Representative whom the Trust has on file. A copy of the Joinder Agreement and the Trust Document—&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;which serve as the official documents establishing the account&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;—will be included in the Toolkit.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;The Toolkit is the Primary Representative&apos;s essential resource for accessing and managing &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Bene_First_Name__c}  {!$Record.Bene_Last_Name__c}&apos;s &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Trust sub-account. The Toolkit should be kept securely and easily accessible for ongoing reference.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;Please review the Toolkit thoroughly and return the attached&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;“Acknowledgement of Policies Form” (Form A) before requesting any disbursements.&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;If you have any questions in the meantime, please feel free to reach out to us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:info@arcare.org&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; color: rgb(11, 92, 171);&quot;&gt;info@arcare.org&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;or (512) 454-6694.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We look forward to working with you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Sincerely,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;THE MASTER POOLED TRUST&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>UnfundedIIOrIVEmailBody</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Confirmation of Trust Enrollment for &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Bene_First_Name__c} {!$Record.Bene_Last_Name__c} &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Dear {!$Record.Primary_Rep_Contact_Lookup__r.FirstName} &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Primary_Rep_Contact_Lookup__r.LastName}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Welcome to the Master Pooled Trust! We are pleased to inform you that the Joinder Agreement {!$Record.Trust_Type__c} submitted on behalf of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Bene_First_Name__c} {!$Record.Bene_Last_Name__c} &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt; has been approved.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Please note that it may take up to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;ten (10) business days&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;for the paperwork to be fully processed in our system and for the enrollment fee to be deposited. We kindly ask for your patience during this time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;Note: &lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Bene_First_Name__c}&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;’s Trust sub-account number will be assigned when the account is funded.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Please don’t hesitate to contact us at&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:info@arcare.org&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; color: rgb(11, 92, 171);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;info@arcare.org&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;(512) 454-6694&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;if you have any questions regarding funding the account.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We look forward to working with you!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Sincerely,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;THE MASTER POOLED TRUST&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</text>
    </textTemplates>
    <textTemplates>
        <name>UnfundedIorIIIEmailBody</name>
        <isViewedAsPlainText>false</isViewedAsPlainText>
        <text>&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Confirmation of Trust Enrollment for {!$Record.Bene_First_Name__c} &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Bene_Last_Name__c} &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Dear {!$Record.Grantor_Contact_Lookup__r.FirstName} &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;{!$Record.Grantor_Contact_Lookup__r.LastName}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Welcome to the Master Pooled Trust! We are pleased to inform you that the Joinder Agreement {!$Record.Trust_Type__c} submitted on behalf of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt; {!$Record.Bene_First_Name__c} {!$Record.Bene_Last_Name__c}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt; has been approved.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Please note that it may take up to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;u&gt;ten (10) business days&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;for the paperwork to be fully processed in our system and for the enrollment fee to be deposited. We kindly ask for your patience during this time.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Next, our Enrollment Team will prepare and send you, the Grantor, a hard copy of the Enrollment Guide, which is also attached here. This Guide will walk you through helpful information about the Trust and its processes, detail how to prepare for funding {!$Record.Beneficiary__r.FirstName}’s account at the appropriate time and have other useful suggestions along the way.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Included in the hard copy Enrollment Guide, you will find a copy of the signed Joinder Agreement and Supplemental Information Form, a copy of the Trust Document and other helpful resources. We encourage you to review the Guide thoroughly to get a clear understanding of your role in&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt; {!$Record.Beneficiary__r.FirstName}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&apos;s Trust.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We’re here to support you every step of the way to ensure a smooth and successful transition of funds for the sole benefit of &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt; {!$Record.Beneficiary__r.FirstName}&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Please reach out to&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;mailto:info@arcare.org&quot; rel=&quot;noopener noreferrer&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif; color: rgb(11, 92, 171);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;info@arcare.org&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;or&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;(512) 454-6694&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;if&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;you have questions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: sans-serif;&quot;&gt;We look forward to